==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|ἀφορῐστικος}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|aphorist|ic}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/æfəˈɹɪstɪk/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of, relating to, or containing [[aphorism]]s, [[maxim]]s or [[epigram]]s; [[gnomic]].
#* {{RQ:De Quincey Letters to a Young Man whose Education has been Neglected}}
#*: The method of the book is '''aphoristic'''.

